                    <span>2 Placas por R$ 140,00</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#e0efd5]">
                    <div className="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c8ff00] flex items-center justify-center text-[#070d04] shrink-0 font-bold">
                      ✓
